      "published": "2026-08-06T11:22:20Z",
      "bullets": [
        "An authorization vulnerability in AI meeting assistant tl;dv exposed 181,874 recorded meetings, transcripts, and sensitive enterprise data.",
        "The breach highlights security risks in third-party meeting bots lacking proper object-level access validation (BOLA/IDOR) on media assets.",
        "Security teams should audit third-party AI integrations and restrict automated meeting recorders from capturing confidential operational discussions."
      ]
    },
